This is the RAMSES parameter file for a circularly polarized Alfven wave along (1,1,0)/sqrt(2).
It is an exact nonlinear solution, back to its initial state after one period, t=1/sqrt(2).
Compile the code with:
make COMPILER=NVHPC NDIM=3 HYDRO=1 MHD=1 INIT=CPAW

&RUN_PARAMS
hydro=.true.
ncontrol=1
/

&AMR_PARAMS
levelmin=6
levelmax=6
ngridmax=50000
nexpand=1
boxlen=1.0
/

&INIT_PARAMS
A_ave=0.70710678118654752
B_ave=0.70710678118654752
/

&OUTPUT_PARAMS
tout=0.70710678118654752
/

&HYDRO_PARAMS
gamma=1.6666666666666667
courant_factor=0.8
slope_type=2
slope_mag_type=2
riemann='hlld'
riemann2d='hlld'
/
